// 輸入框外觀：淺灰底，取得焦點時變卡片底並出現 1.5px 外框（設計稿 .search.focus / .dd-t.open）。
// 取得焦點時提示字往右滑開淡出、左側圖示變深、鍵盤提示淡出。
import { Theme, Motion } from "../theme.slint";
import { Icon } from "icons.slint";

export component TextField {
    in-out property <string> text;
    in property <string> placeholder;
    /// 左側圖示（Icons.xxx）
    in property <string> icon;
    /// 右側鍵盤提示（例如 "/"），空字串不顯示；取得焦點時隱藏
    in property <string> hint;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <bool> read-only: false;
    in property <InputType> input-type: InputType.text;
    in property <length> font-size: 14.5px;
    in property <length> radius: Theme.radius-field;
    out property <bool> has-focus: input.has-focus;
    callback accepted(text: string);
    callback edited(text: string);
    /// 在輸入框處理之前攔截按鍵（例如上下鍵切換結果）；回傳 accept 表示已處理
    callback key-intercept(event: KeyEvent) -> EventResult;
    key-intercept(e) => {
        EventResult.reject
    }
    // focus()／clear-focus() 透過 forward-focus 轉給內部輸入框
    forward-focus: input;
    public function select-all() {
        input.select-all();
    }
    height: 48px;
    min-width: 120px;
    opacity: enabled ? 1 : 0.5;
    Rectangle {
        background: input.has-focus ? Theme.card : Theme.fill;
        border-radius: root.radius;
        border-width: 1.5px;
        border-color: input.has-focus ? Theme.ink : transparent;
        animate background, border-color { duration: Motion.fast + 60ms; }
    }
    TouchArea {
        mouse-cursor: MouseCursor.text;
        clicked => {
            input.focus();
        }
    }
    HorizontalLayout {
        padding-left: 14px;
        padding-right: 14px;
        spacing: 10px;
        if root.icon != "": Icon {
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            path: root.icon;
            color: input.has-focus ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            animate color { duration: Motion.fast; }
        }
        Rectangle {
            horizontal-stretch: 1;
            // 打的字比框長時不要畫到框外面（TextInput 會跟著游標捲動）；
            // 最小寬度 0：不然長字串會把這格撐得比輸入框還寬，字就跑出框外
            clip: true;
            min-width: 0px;
            // 提示字：取得焦點時往右滑開淡出；一打字就直接消失（不跟輸入的字疊在一起）
            Text {
                property <float> on: input.text == "" && !input.has-focus ? 1 : 0;
                animate on { duration: input.text != "" ? 0ms : Motion.fast; easing: Motion.out; }
                x: Theme.reduce-motion ? 0px : (1 - self.on) * 8px;
                width: parent.width - self.x;
                text: root.placeholder;
                visible: self.on > 0;
                opacity: self.on;
                color: Theme.muted;
                font-size: root.font-size;
                font-weight: 500;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            FocusScope {
                capture-key-pressed(e) => {
                    root.key-intercept(e)
                }
                input := TextInput {
                    width: parent.width;
                    height: parent.height;
                    text <=> root.text;
                    enabled: root.enabled;
                    read-only: root.read-only;
                    input-type: root.input-type;
                    single-line: true;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                    color: Theme.ink;
                    font-size: root.font-size;
                    font-weight: 500;
                    selection-background-color: Theme.accent-soft;
                    selection-foreground-color: Theme.ink;
                    text-cursor-width: 1.5px;
                    accepted => {
                        root.accepted(self.text);
                    }
                    edited => {
                        root.edited(self.text);
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        if root.hint != "" && !input.has-focus: Rectangle {
            property <float> t: 0;
            init => {
                self.t = 1;
            }
            animate t { duration: Motion.fast; }
            opacity: self.t;
            y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
            height: 20px;
            width: kbd.preferred-width + 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            background: Theme.card;
            kbd := Text {
                text: root.hint;
                color: Theme.muted;
                font-size: 11px;
            }
        }
    }
}
